27#issuecomment-3649063237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/3927","id":3649063237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7ZgElF","user":{"login":"JS3910","id":31373791,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzczNzkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31373791?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910","html_url":"https://github.com/JS3910","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JS3910/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T07:07:14Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T07:08:37Z","body":"> LLMs do have a max context window. It's gotten larger, but it's still possible to hit it.\n\nThis issue was never at any point about context window size. Context window sizes increasing will not fix this problem and is not reason to close it as \"completed\". \n\nThis is about vscode claiming that the RESPONSE generated by the LLM is too long and that the user should somehow ask a question or give an instruction which will result in a shorter reply from the LLM which is a nonsensical error message that the user can't possibly follow.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3649063237/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimiz